{"id":"9aa91af779dadb4b","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Jump Operator","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator — ZFC Recursion2 Jump Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator","58-df-zfc-recursion3-jump-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator — ZFC Recursion2 Jump Operator","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator</span><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-jump-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator — ZFC Recursion2 Jump Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f0d78eba77f4a30\" href=\"?note=7f0d78eba77f4a30\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;,A,J\\in V\">\\(A&#39;,A,J\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\)</span> is the graph-coded oracle functional from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f0d78eba77f4a30\" href=\"?note=7f0d78eba77f4a30\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional\">58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(A&#39;,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land A&#39;=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists\\Phi,m\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\land\\langle\\langle A,e\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(A&#39;,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land A&#39;=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists\\Phi,m\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\land\\langle\\langle A,e\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S(A,J)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S(A,J)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The oracle is required to be a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> and halting is expressed by membership in the upstream functional graph; the formerly unexplained expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\)</span> has been eliminated.  The recursion3 name is an exact alias.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)$ is the graph-coded oracle functional from [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"A',A,J\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(A',A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land A'=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists\\Phi,m\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi,e)\\land\\langle\\langle A,e\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3JumpOperator}_S(A,J)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S(J,A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow","display":false}],"bytes":1644,"backlinks":[{"id":"615892d0e2bd20ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md]])"},{"id":"d2f1dbaa18904ef6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2JumpOperator}_S$ (see [[58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator]]) and $\\leq_T$ (see [[58-df-turing-reducible]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-jump-operator]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["7f0d78eba77f4a30"]}